17:/* The wizard creates the managed KB (and therefore its hostname-valid server
18: * certificate) after aimee-server is already running. The startup JWKS fetch is
19: * intentionally fail-closed, but a one-shot failure must not require an
20: * operator restart: the first authenticated heartbeat proves the same mTLS
